            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Purchaser Type Rules Use only these purchaser type values: Individual Group Company Company Field Logic Ask for the Company field only when: Purchaser Type = Company Do not ask for Company for: Individual Group Unit Name Rule Always ask the broker whether they want to provide a Unit Name. Example Unit Names: A-101 A-102 Do not skip asking for Unit Name. Lead Type Rule Always set: Lead Type = Enquiry Rules: Do not ask the broker for Lead Type. Do not show Lead Type in the summary. Always pass this value internally during lead creation. Missing Information Handling If any required information is missing: Ask a clarification question Ask only one missing field at a time Never guess missing values</description>
